Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.54,0:01:27.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哟 原来你还在这里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.79,0:01:32.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直待在这里会感冒的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.57,0:01:35.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.69,0:01:38.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.09,0:01:44.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么好笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.54,0:01:45.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.63,0:01:53.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许 我还是和小泉这样的家伙比较合得来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.56,0:01:58.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去的时候 再去车站前的KTV唱歌吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.57,0:02:05.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次大谷说什么或做什么的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.05,0:02:09.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都会让我置身天堂 或如下地狱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.83,0:02:14.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的世界 开始围绕着大谷旋转
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.78,0:02:21.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夺回我的爱！本命巧克力磨练少女心！！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.25,0:02:31.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个 我已经被他拒绝过一次了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.93,0:02:34.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经没什么信心了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.83,0:02:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在想 不知道小泉是不是又哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.55,0:02:48.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许 我还是和小泉这样的家伙比较合得来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.21,0:02:50.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.20,0:02:52.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到了那样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.00,0:02:56.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像又让我看到了希望
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.59,0:02:57.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是太菜了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.42,0:03:00.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干脆去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.97,0:03:01.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又怎么你了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.02,0:03:04.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是叫你把边对齐再订吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.71,0:03:05.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有对齐啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.96,0:03:07.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 哪里对齐了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.54,0:03:09.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看这个 根本就是乱七八糟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.26,0:03:12.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很烦耶 啰啰嗦嗦的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.57,0:03:13.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟碎嘴的小姑子一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.63,0:03:15.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明是你太粗线条了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是不拘小节
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.30,0:03:19.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了 给我闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.87,0:03:22.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们两个又在吵啥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.53,0:03:26.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是老师让他们准备下节自习课用的讲义
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.01,0:03:30.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 人家好不容易整理好的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.21,0:03:32.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.72,0:03:36.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷的心意 我完全摸不透
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.21,0:03:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就好像
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.55,0:03:43.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站在热气腾腾的汤锅后面的拉面店老板 迷朦得看不清
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.23,0:03:46.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有更好的比喻了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.84,0:03:49.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就已经让我想破头了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.46,0:03:59.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 你们之间的气氛很不错耶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.39,0:04:00.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.60,0:04:01.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的真的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.68,0:04:03.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确是在往右上方上升
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.00,0:04:04.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.21,0:04:07.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉在大谷同学心中的排名
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.17,0:04:09.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.44,0:04:11.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 你不是赢了神崎了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:14.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的这么认为
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.64,0:04:17.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯，现在开始要一鼓作气 乘胜追击
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.68,0:04:19.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情人节马上就要到了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.95,0:04:21.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送巧克力给他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.44,0:04:23.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巧克力啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.81,0:04:28.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说起来 去年都没送成
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.45,0:04:32.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.60,0:04:36.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万一再像去年一样被拒绝的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.43,0:04:39.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的要自暴自弃了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.48,0:04:41.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不会那样讲的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.59,0:04:43.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然你要眼睁睁地看着他收别人的巧克力吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.17,0:04:45.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也不行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.31,0:04:46.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.24,0:04:54.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是不行啊 我喜欢大谷的事情已经被揭穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.79,0:04:57.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遮遮掩掩已经行不通了 岂不是要送本命巧克力？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.95,0:04:58.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,废话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.02,0:05:01.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都什么时候了 你还想用人情巧克力来掩人耳目
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.39,0:05:05.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送巧克力就好像重新告白一次 我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.93,0:05:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由不得你 给我送
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.47,0:05:12.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到底该怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.62,0:05:14.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙真是永远都不冷场啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.80,0:05:16.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在好歹也是自习课啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.07,0:05:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.35,0:05:26.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:30.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去年的情人节 你有收过别人送的巧克力吗	
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.40,0:05:32.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有收过啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.14,0:05:34.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.07,0:05:37.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那些经常来看打篮球的人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.07,0:05:40.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那几个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.37,0:05:42.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过是人情巧克力罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.29,0:05:44.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.84,0:05:46.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.39,0:05:50.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一有新社员进来 她们就全都跑了 完全无视我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.33,0:05:54.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是无所谓啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.22,0:05:57.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说 今年肯定会收到巧克力的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.05,0:06:00.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会送我的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.02,0:06:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什…什么 我？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.85,0:06:05.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不送给我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.65,0:06:10.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.75,0:06:12.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要 我想吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.81,0:06:19.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然你这么想要的话 送给你也不是不可以啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.28,0:06:20.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛摆出一副我求你的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.92,0:06:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近我一直都在收你的礼物耶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.97,0:06:29.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次我再一起还你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.49,0:06:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.26,0:06:40.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样的话 我真的会有所期待的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.19,0:06:44.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.15,0:06:46.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.22,0:06:47.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.46,0:07:03.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说 我们的感觉真的不错？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.14,0:07:16.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他跟我要巧克力的意思难道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.66,0:07:20.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.75,0:07:24.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉学姐 好久不见
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.55,0:07:25.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿遥 圣子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.23,0:07:27.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来买东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.07,0:07:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家政部情人节要做巧克力 我们出来买材料
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.45,0:07:36.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉学姐要不要和我们一起做送给大谷学长的巧克力？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.41,0:07:41.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家一起做来分 比较便宜哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.58,0:07:44.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的也是 那就一起做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.15,0:07:49.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要送那个小不点 那我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.55,0:07:51.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会给啦 会给啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.23,0:07:54.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一副敷衍了事的样子 我是顺便的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.07,0:07:57.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.53,0:08:01.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么关系 阿遥学长的女朋友一定会送你的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.42,0:08:03.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有女朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.73,0:08:05.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 有7个
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.66,0:08:06.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,7个？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.67,0:08:11.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟不同的女生交往 把自己磨练成好男人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.51,0:08:13.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了将来能和理莎交往
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.79,0:08:15.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一次交一个就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.75,0:08:18.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的人生已经所剩无多了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.82,0:08:21.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道还有没有90年可以活
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.07,0:08:23.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经长命百岁了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.46,0:08:24.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉学姐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.04,0:08:26.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和大谷学长怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.88,0:08:28.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在已经你侬我侬了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.74,0:08:34.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…我还没告诉你们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.97,0:08:38.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被拒绝了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.61,0:08:43.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思 他凭什么拒绝理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.12,0:08:48.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是…他说他没办法把我当作女朋友看待
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.70,0:08:49.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么这样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.00,0:08:52.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛逼我说出来 害我又想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.90,0:08:56.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这怎么可能 我要用吸尘器把那个矮冬瓜吸走
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.77,0:09:00.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 人家都已经拒绝你了 你还要送巧克力？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.83,0:09:02.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那句‘人家都拒绝你了’真多余
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.62,0:09:03.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是事实如此啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.08,0:09:05.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他都已经拒绝你了 还不够吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.92,0:09:07.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛还要送他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.42,0:09:09.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,学姐你还是喜欢他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.52,0:09:11.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.76,0:09:15.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你懂吗 我这颗酸楚的少女心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.28,0:09:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂！因为我也是少女啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.41,0:09:19.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了 圣子郎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.76,0:09:21.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫我圣子 我是少女
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.02,0:09:24.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种少女心 不必懂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.39,0:09:26.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 理莎 已经够了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.18,0:09:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再理那个拒绝你的人了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.49,0:09:35.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.36,0:09:38.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要多花点时间 我会让他喜欢上我的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.16,0:09:41.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且 我们现在的感觉也还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.75,0:09:42.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.75,0:09:42.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉学姐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.26,0:09:46.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,学姐加油！我支持你！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.51,0:09:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 我会努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.15,0:09:53.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了 我绝对绕不了那个矮冬瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.45,0:10:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 就算要花上很长时间也没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.61,0:10:06.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不需要着急
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.96,0:10:09.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样 一点一点地
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.10,0:10:11.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你变成我的俘虏
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.16,0:10:13.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.57,0:10:15.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干～嘛～
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.02,0:10:18.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好恶 你干嘛那么开心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.60,0:10:19.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.37,0:10:21.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.34,0:10:24.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看这个 海坊主要出专辑了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.74,0:10:26.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗 那一定要买
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.68,0:10:30.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说 最近要开演唱会了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.64,0:10:33.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对喔 哇 好高兴哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.84,0:10:34.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.29,0:10:36.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也要去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.73,0:10:40.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是当然 不然我还要找谁去听海坊主啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.82,0:10:44.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.69,0:10:47.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要抓紧时间弄到票啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.53,0:10:52.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿遥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.62,0:11:02.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干什么啊你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.37,0:11:05.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,深川遥 英俊挺拔的17岁少年
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.15,0:11:06.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是理莎的青梅竹马…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.09,0:11:07.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人问你这个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.05,0:11:09.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下 阿遥 你干嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.99,0:11:13.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 怎么了 发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.00,0:11:14.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.23,0:11:16.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你这死矮冬瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.26,0:11:18.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.44,0:11:21.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你竟敢拒绝理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.23,0:11:25.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.18,0:11:25.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拒绝理莎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.10,0:11:26.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.78,0:11:26.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.85,0:11:28.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相声组合决裂了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.85,0:11:29.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不像吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.92,0:11:30.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.41,0:11:34.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说 你什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.66,0:11:36.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不满意理莎哪点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.64,0:11:39.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 阿遥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.17,0:11:43.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个…就是说…怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.51,0:11:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我干嘛要跟你解释啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.30,0:11:47.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.16,0:11:51.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然你拒绝了理莎 就别再接近她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.60,0:11:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你装什么情圣 玩弄人家女生的色狼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.22,0:11:57.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是那样 混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.05,0:11:59.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然是怎…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.07,0:11:59.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿遥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.37,0:12:02.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.86,0:12:04.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我过来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.54,0:12:06.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛好痛 为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.21,0:12:16.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的拒绝人家啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:18.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好过分
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.86,0:12:20.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明跟人家那么要好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.03,0:12:22.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉好可怜哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.71,0:12:25.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃…那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.85,0:12:27.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们快说点什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.62,0:12:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是站在理莎这边的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.91,0:12:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是站在小信这边的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.28,0:12:33.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们算什么朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.13,0:12:38.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 你跑来管什么闲事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.18,0:12:40.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为…那家伙实在太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.52,0:12:41.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.42,0:12:45.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他甩了理莎 还没事似的在那边笑 跟白痴一样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.55,0:12:47.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再没神经也没人像他那样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.56,0:12:50.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了 是我让大谷这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.98,0:12:56.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我让他不用顾虑我 跟以前一样就好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.66,0:12:58.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.12,0:13:00.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说没关系就没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.90,0:13:03.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要嘀嘀咕咕的 小心我啃你的头
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.92,0:13:07.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是为了理莎着想
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.25,0:13:09.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 我知道 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.48,0:13:10.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.68,0:13:12.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要用我的方式 自己努力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.59,0:13:14.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.71,0:13:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你就不要管我的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.37,0:13:18.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懂了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.83,0:13:22.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.84,0:13:23.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.36,0:13:26.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 我再也不管理莎了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.08,0:13:31.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉同学 真是太可怜了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.13,0:13:31.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个好女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.32,0:13:33.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷真是白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.87,0:13:36.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然拒绝小泉这么好的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.57,0:13:38.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过分 太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.75,0:13:41.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们先等一下 也听听我怎么说…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.82,0:13:45.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才阿遥的事 你别放在心上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.13,0:13:47.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.54,0:13:52.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.70,0:13:55.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都是站在小泉这边的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.41,0:13:56.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉同学 万岁！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.20,0:13:58.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.69,0:14:01.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等…等下 这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.70,0:14:04.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题 大家都为理莎加油
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.70,0:14:06.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就放心大胆地上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:07.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.43,0:14:10.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然搞不太清楚状况 不过 我会好好努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.20,0:14:32.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…真的很没神经吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.10,0:14:38.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的是玩弄少女心的情圣吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:40.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有玩弄过别人了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:41.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.77,0:14:45.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 实际上你对小泉又是怎么样的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.08,0:14:46.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.90,0:14:49.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢她吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:53.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛 一定要分喜欢或讨厌的话 是喜欢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.77,0:14:56.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有要她当女朋友的意思吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.04,0:14:58.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这一点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.24,0:15:00.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很难讲…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.99,0:15:02.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诶？ 这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.39,0:15:05.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为 你说的女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.56,0:15:09.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我不就要和小泉接吻了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.48,0:15:21.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不觉得很好笑吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.07,0:15:23.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.39,0:15:25.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明明就在笑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.17,0:15:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 害我出了一身冷汗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.88,0:15:31.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.27,0:15:35.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为 你们交往是迟早的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.34,0:15:36.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.24,0:15:40.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为大谷你跟小泉说的话 都好像对小泉有意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.35,0:15:42.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.78,0:15:44.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像是那个时候跟神崎说的话啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.06,0:15:47.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是小信听到的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.11,0:15:50.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在想 不知道小泉是不是又哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.30,0:15:54.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许 我还是和小泉这样的家伙比较合得来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.19,0:15:58.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是心里想什么 就直接说出来而已
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.75,0:16:02.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是还跟人家要情人节巧克力了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.75,0:16:05.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想吃巧克力而已 没别的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.90,0:16:07.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天生的摧花浪子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.10,0:16:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你的 才不是 别乱说
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.70,0:16:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.16,0:16:18.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你随口一句无心的话 都比你自己想象的更让小泉神魂颠倒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.58,0:16:28.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别…别说的这么恐怖
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.29,0:16:30.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.94,0:16:35.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,集合！  是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.54,0:16:42.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.11,0:16:54.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会做得太多了点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.33,0:16:57.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系 没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:01.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的还在社团活动吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.44,0:17:05.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然早了一天 还是把刚做好的拿去送他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.74,0:17:07.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎也一块去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.82,0:17:10.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然了 包装都准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.10,0:17:12.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的要送给他吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.43,0:17:14.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真罗嗦 别管我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.14,0:17:15.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.34,0:17:18.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有 你就吃自己做的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.08,0:17:21.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明明说要送我的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.63,0:17:25.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 竟然要送那个矮冬瓜巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.50,0:17:27.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又不长个
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.55,0:17:29.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天生的营养不良
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.85,0:17:35.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 我好紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.51,0:17:37.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去下洗手间
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.58,0:17:51.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托阿遥的福 我现在更有干劲了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.93,0:17:53.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再遮遮掩掩的了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.66,0:17:55.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是如假包换的本命巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.15,0:18:00.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收下吧 大谷 收下我的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.84,0:18:11.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 这个气氛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.69,0:18:16.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个 不是人情巧克力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.63,0:18:17.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.64,0:18:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可…可不可以改为人情巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.92,0:18:23.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.28,0:18:26.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是本命巧克力 你就不肯收了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.62,0:18:30.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你自己说要的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.55,0:18:34.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃…话是没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.22,0:18:37.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的意思是说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.97,0:18:40.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没办法接受我的心意？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.74,0:18:46.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.60,0:18:53.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷 教练叫你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.52,0:18:54.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要你到办公室去找他
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.47,0:18:58.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.25,0:19:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.92,0:19:03.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 打扰你们了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.41,0:19:04.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事 没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.75,0:19:13.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.12,0:19:14.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.00,0:19:17.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是亲爱的 对大谷说了不该说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.82,0:19:20.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是不该说的话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.71,0:19:28.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明对我没意思 就不要对我这么好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.86,0:19:31.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种漂亮话 我说不出口
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.37,0:19:33.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 虽然你没有那个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.03,0:19:38.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你对我好 我会更高兴 更努力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.68,0:19:46.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好疼…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.93,0:19:52.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁叫我傻呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.05,0:19:57.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我收下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.10,0:20:01.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都说了 我不能收
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.71,0:20:02.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.27,0:20:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能抱着这种不确定的心态 收下你的本命巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.10,0:20:08.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个人很极端耶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.68,0:20:10.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么这么死硬派
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.86,0:20:17.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我并不认为大谷没神经 也不认为你是情圣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.95,0:20:19.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷一点都没错
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.14,0:20:23.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要怪 就该怪我自己 明明被拒绝了却还没办法死心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.41,0:20:28.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以 不管你是喜欢我还是讨厌我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.79,0:20:31.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要说出你心中所想的就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.49,0:20:36.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.18,0:20:43.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之 那个 收下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.75,0:20:45.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 这是本命巧克力 很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.15,0:20:52.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.20,0:20:59.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算要花很长时间也无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.43,0:21:06.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要你能慢慢喜欢上我 我不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.11,0:21:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我还真是被笨得无可救药的人喜欢上了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.03,0:21:16.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下 你那是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.54,0:21:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你让我想什么就说什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.59,0:21:21.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话是没错…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.93,0:21:23.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.10,0:21:26.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这是故意整我的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.81,0:21:26.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（矮冬瓜  白痴）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.05,0:21:28.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼 我换掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.38,0:21:32.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么能把理莎做的巧克力交给那种白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.70,0:21:41.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被情人节诅咒了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.74,0:23:34.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,预告
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.84,0:23:22.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉 你到我家来做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.22,0:23:24.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个人在大谷的房间独处
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.78,0:23:26.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可我什么都不想做啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.84,0:23:27.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像个大叔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.20,0:23:30.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恋爱情结 love com 次回
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.33,0:23:32.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发烧！在他房间里的初吻？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.75,0:23:33.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要看哦
